              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m02_l02_cpq06_p03_c02",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate estimated IQR = 295.2 - 137.5 = 157.7 hours (or 158 to 3 s.f.)."
            },
            {
              "criterion_id": "9709_s1_t_representation_of_data_m02_l02_cpq06_p03_c03",
              "mark": "A1",
              "text": "Calculate greatest theoretical IQR: max(Q3) - min(Q1) = 300 - 100 = 200 hours."
            }
          ]
        }
